V1: the SMF fade of the corrected hero downlink (backlog 2-AO)
date          : 2026-09-07      seed: 20260907      preset: standard
outer scale   : L0 = 25 m (the owner rule, backlog 2-P5)
precision     : single      fft backend: cupy      workers: None
scenario      : downlink, 1550 nm, 500 km, 700 mm ground SMF, 100 mm space terminal
caveat        : PERFECT AO. It is an ideal modal fit of one snapshot: no sensor noise, no lag, no anisoplanatism.

The stacks: base (no correction), tiptilt (3 Noll modes), ao10 (10), ao21 (21).
pX is the loss EXCEEDED X percent of the time. A LARGE loss is a deep fade.

